      "desc_zh": "可以修改 Kickback 的攻击，用 T-Clog 感染他的对手。这种网络病毒会攻击机器人控制其变形能力的敏感电子设备。\n\n重击：{{var_15}} 几率用 T-Clog 感染对手，将对手的功率降低 -{{var_16}} 至 {{var_17}}。如果受感染的机器人使用重击，T-Clog 会被移除并且他们的转变失败，从而使他们陷入 {{var_18}} 状态。\n\n+每级大约 {{var_19}}",
      "desc_en": "T-Cog Sabotage\nKickback’s attacks can be modified to infect his opponent with T-Clog. This cyber virus attacks the bot’s sensitive electronics that control their ability to Transform.\nHeavy Attacks: {{var_15}} chance to infect an opponent with T-Clog, lowering the opponent’s Power Rate by -{{var_16}} for {{var_17}}. If the infected bot uses a Heavy Attack, T-Clog is removed and their Transformation fails, Stunning them for {{var_18}}.\n+about {{var_19}} per level",
